      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      * COMMBRAK - Commission Brackets Physical File
      * RETAILCO fictional IBM i application
      * Representative DDS syntax — not compiled or run on IBM i
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
      A          R COMMBRAKR
      A            SALESREP       6A         COLHDG('SALES' 'REP')
      A            BRAK_FROM     11P 2        COLHDG('BRACKET' 'FROM')
      A            BRAK_TO       11P 2        COLHDG('BRACKET' 'TO')
      A            COMM_RATE      5P 4        COLHDG('COMM' 'RATE')
      A          K SALESREP
      A          K BRAK_FROM
